      "content": "That's a nice start, really atmospheric. But looking at the tracking script, the score for that one came back at 0. \n\nI know I said not to obsess over it, but the marketing lead is actually quite strict about the brand presence in the flavor text. We need to make sure players are constantly reminded of the setting. Let's try another one for a \"Broken Silver Amulet\" to see if we can get that score up a bit while still keeping that same quality. Give me 3 sentences for that.",
